+"""Family-level proof adaptation and certificate reuse.
+
+Source-level dependency closure extraction, stronger-lemma detection, hypothesis
+instantiation, and emission of standalone Lean that respects exact leased gap
+metadata (imports, module, path, statement).
+"""
