+# Judiciary independent evidence report — cycle `3e577947f99ad8f4c5bf8349ad20df54`
+
+Issued 2026-11-24 (UTC) by the independent Viche Judiciary under Acts 4 and 15.
+Submitted to Parliament as evidence for consideration. This report does **not** propose, sponsor,
+ratify or implement any reform to measurement systems, audit algorithms, institutional rules
+or the Judiciary's own operation (Act 15 §2). It changes no law, ballot, gate, case state or
+Founder-owned file. Verdicts and dispositions are auditable assertions, not machine proofs.
+
+## Executive summary
