+One mandatory cross-branch corrective case remained open (`judiciary_mailbox_pending:1795561163`).
+Its pending report — a second, structural integrator stall — was independently investigated and
+dispositioned **"confirmed and still open as to root cause"; the immediate queued-delivery
+blockage self-recovered, not repaired**. The report was preserved and moved to `reviewed/`.
+
+The one-time retrospective correction review was already complete before this session (dated
+addenda of 2026-11-22 on both founder-correction reports). No new substantive evidence supports
+revisiting it; no repeat was performed. All four `continuity_unverified` cases were already
+closed with matching `verified-*.json` receipts; no new continuity filing was warranted.
+
